Online Free guitar lesson on Kaise Bataaoon Guitar Chords with strumming pattern for beginners along with lyrics from the movie 3G sung by K K and Sonal Chauhan.

Technology is a part of our lives as we all know, but what happens when technology wants to take our lives? 3G is the nightmarish story of a couple Sam Arora (Neil Nitin Mukesh) and Sheena (Sonal Chauhan), who go on a holiday in Fiji islands and become victims of a series of events when Sam buys a 3G enabled second hand phone. It's a sci-fi and horror movie. The title line of movie is 3G get ready for the killer connection!

Strumming Pattern : D U DDU

